WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:14.770
Hello.

2
00:00:14.771 --> 00:00:19.109
Who are you?

3
00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:23.044
I'm a turkey vulture.

4
00:00:23.045 --> 00:00:27.095
We are raptors.

5
00:00:27.096 --> 00:00:31.588
Raptors are birds that hunt for food.

6
00:00:31.589 --> 00:00:34.310
Where do you live?

7
00:00:34.311 --> 00:00:38.168
We live in North America.

8
00:00:38.169 --> 00:00:43.565
We like open places like fields.

9
00:00:43.566 --> 00:00:46.150
What do you eat?

10
00:00:46.151 --> 00:00:49.932
Turkey vultures eat dead animals.

11
00:00:49.933 --> 00:00:53.499
We can smell very well.

12
00:00:53.500 --> 00:01:02.163
We smell to find food.

13
00:01:02.164 --> 00:01:07.653
Yikes! You eat dead animals?

14
00:01:07.654 --> 00:01:11.945
Yes. We are a big help to nature.

15
00:01:11.946 --> 00:01:15.293
We clean up fields and roads.

16
00:01:15.294 --> 00:01:19.847
And we never attack living animals.

17
00:01:19.848 --> 00:01:22.812
Do you live alone?

18
00:01:22.813 --> 00:01:24.554
Nope!

19
00:01:24.555 --> 00:01:28.196
Turkey vultures often eat together.

20
00:01:28.197 --> 00:01:32.288
We fly and sleep together too.

21
00:01:32.289 --> 00:01:35.668
Your beak looks sharp!

22
00:01:35.669 --> 00:01:39.476
Our beaks are very sharp.

23
00:01:39.477 --> 00:01:42.609
They help us eat.

24
00:01:42.610 --> 00:01:46.391
We can even eat big animals.

25
00:01:46.392 --> 00:01:49.061
Do you build nests?

26
00:01:49.062 --> 00:01:52.581
We don't build real nests.

27
00:01:52.582 --> 00:01:56.679
We look for holes in rocks or logs.

28
00:01:56.680 --> 00:02:01.495
We like old buildings and caves too.

29
00:02:01.496 --> 00:02:06.913
I'm hungry again. Bye!

30
00:02:06.914 --> 00:02:13.648
See you later, Turkey Vulture!
